xt, look for forbidden markers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three possible actions:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Skip - the information goes on without interference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Ban - the person can no longer share data, but remains alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Eliminate - extreme measure: the character disappears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >News every working day: satirical headlines reflecting the public mood appear at the end of the shift (7 days in total).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humor and Easter hints: sarcastic memes, posters, different events every working day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732390/extras/bbc99f66207ddfe898a033a9dac02f11.poster.avif?t=1761150986\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732390/extras/bbc99f66207ddfe898a033a9dac02f11.webm?t=1761150986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732390/extras/bbc99f66207ddfe898a033a9dac02f11.mp4?t=1761150986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And good job!</i></p>", "short_description": "Immerse yourself in the rigors of working at the RKM. Join the ranks of the supervisory staff and experience the responsibility (and absurdity) of content filtering.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732390/7b9d1b858ddc1e06fadf0824d3ed2c155659d0c4/header.jpg?t=1761150986", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732390/a365ec1b35d14cec223c2c3c6cdd4c6626cf4dba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761150986", "capsule_i